# WS2-01. # Sources: spec/03-ownership.md §3 (moves; a moved value is never dropped), §5 (drop order: locals in reverse declaration order, struct fields in declaration order, array elements first to last, parameters after the body locals; drops on every return/break/continue; exactly once), spec/04-expressions.md §3 (temporaries drop at statement end in reverse creation order).
# Returning an owned local moves it out; it is dropped once by the caller.
profiles: host
with: tok.clo
expect: output
contrast: make(5) ==> make(6)
contrast-expect: output
--- output
use 5
end
drop 5
--- contrast-output
use 6
end
drop 6
